  m_Text: 'This is a simple Photon Chat room demo

    The Canvas contains multiple
    Panels for different context.

    They are disabled intentionally, so scripts
    can activate them.

    The script IgnoreUiRaycastWhenInactive keeps inactive
    panels from blocking input.



    All users should use a UserId (to be found
    as friend).

    This message will go away at runtime.'
